  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "Après la marche, je mange du riz avec mon ami.",
      "sha256": "1e2864b6f76171953fa50d970298ebedeb196fd07e9b5b8059f744c046146ba0",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:7:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Après la visite, ils marchent dans un quartier tranquille.",
      "sha256": "5d56dcbb61f91c976bd0d14b1b4ee4aa6787d432f603ed0566f0718cf013114e",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:10:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Aujourd'hui, je vais au zoo avec un ami.",
      "sha256": "3f72be89d64af536c0eb45dad74b3a4da16f4980f673da83d2052990f9d1ae6e",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[1].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, je vais payer les billets pour ma famille.",
      "sha256": "5acf9df7ce64aacd9a043c95db7ec61d27d6ed66d40a3e11b26afd9a38d72139",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:10:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, les gens regardent la girafe.",
      "sha256": "42b0af38b3fc5555b07214e2ae778aacc8a8e40aa1c2163f3d7ab3370dbc1c32",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, où est la salle dans la zone B ?",
      "sha256": "bd12d47df072866703650dad2088337eecea291f9aa1022e96950834987d11e3",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:8:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "C'est un joli jour pour visiter le zoo.",
      "sha256": "0cf5680c2b9c7f48913a6cc81cf3129f2fa5250fb592078156506fdce49422af",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dans l'entrée, je lis que notre salle est dans la zone B.",
      "sha256": "f52366734264b4c5144c11680572b1e1e2a08739edbfceb5ec039e4a596f521f",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:8:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je lis le journal près de l'entrée.",
      "sha256": "0948b8498342b365978d444fd020f6b62853dcfd5c94e8f75cbeaed351005220",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[10].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je mange du riz après la marche.",
      "sha256": "b6ac92957923af667efce794fd074f51633453bda82063d888edf8b2231b63d6",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:7:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je regarde le billet et je confirme l'heure.",
      "sha256": "a1fbf8da6438cda5f797ac54d43fd7e021a21d89b42d3ae36c0f650961faf9bf",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:8:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je vais au lit après le repas.",
      "sha256": "71cd67c6e80f359ad8212df171e6093c7b4c88a11ab44a1326eecd8f32120447",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:7:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[10].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je vais payer les billets.",
      "sha256": "428b9954b9e971513debb861770312c7e54468b9bb68b3734bb1aecff5fabd64",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:10:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La famille visite la ville.",
      "sha256": "84f01770586963adfa9e9c1c53c5e321facffad6de6e9ff0d9051138b66e5685",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:10:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La façade est rose.",
      "sha256": "789f60e53ee2a3535ea3246458e84f013bf5f3bf38f6412701e587fd46d07fe5",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:8:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La fille a les yeux ouverts.",
      "sha256": "11bbf682cc3dec5757d635c341f886f177583b767c0793b55d64a4df6d4cb7d9",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:10:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La fille regarde une vitrine avec les yeux grands ouverts.",
      "sha256": "bbb00939a572e766d3352094cd37cdd80cfc7e1b041ea279526f28525a41f8f5",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:10:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La ligne bleue mène au lac.",
      "sha256": "3b212133202c7237b9be94ce0949ecdd0d8873af0eb9107a68bfa70357230692",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:7:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:7:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La salle est dans la zone B.",
      "sha256": "a755868f3caf0a8c3128f5b4c48a03a178db1f2880f5148e1ead1e0a7a54678d",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:8:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le cinéma est derrière la maison.",
      "sha256": "3afce0dff9c06789399f63ed3ab04b3e9d917d36f9b522e38b25e31b4bdefb43",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:8:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le cinéma se trouve derrière une maison à la façade rose.",
      "sha256": "3117df14a6ade7d420f0d6cf4e89000eab765119f2dda69f11438e91fcc35579",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:8:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[1].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le guide porte un gilet.",
      "sha256": "1cc65f305f254d6db979006f145daeb539ea362c8d58f111a80e307847e3a919",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lac est au bout de la route.",
      "sha256": "c9959e2d293963e238c007149ac0c453b1f6f969e0ef098fbcf46fc65dba1fd3",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:7:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le quartier est tranquille.",
      "sha256": "c48d8c17cec09ae79713d43a1a2bae53ca938a88eb371a8fbd3ec66a54c8467d",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:10:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[10].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le soir, je vais au lit en pensant au lac.",
      "sha256": "2285a77efefb6244ec36423f972a6e5e24b2f52d2eeab161265cddea7481cd4a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:7:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Les gens regardent la girafe pendant que je prends une photo.",
      "sha256": "d19a1207689abf158557bad93c3bffe88a73fd75b5f9b2fabb773568669ce74a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Les gens regardent la girafe.",
      "sha256": "a7b87e9f9af6d57258f76feefad2f10a2532aafab964c53b57830c72b26df675",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, c'est un joli jour au zoo.",
      "sha256": "5822f5efacfb21640524d183f552d391d99d5848594ac2d958888f07621b6daa",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, j'ai trouvé la salle.",
      "sha256": "fc34cc083342dfa33cb419abfd152bab5e082c7c0bcad006fe7af4f85f0e014a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:8:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, nous allons visiter la ville.",
      "sha256": "5560197c2df6dcfd6ed209c76216ab557946afaf631f19877efb1665651536d0",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:10:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mon ami demande : « Ça commence à six heures ? »",
      "sha256": "d7caf331eebc1b71e40fa77d7f6f03866d2e02164dcef633e9099db5578bc2a6",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:8:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nous suivons une route qui traverse une rue du village.",
      "sha256": "7a604c5f54f3989cd4f0052dfb35505cd7ce75de2b97c10c8629f9f355051ef5",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:7:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[1].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Oui, le lac est au bout de la route.",
      "sha256": "71c01331e522d0ccaa56ea2f32e77718dc7e4fc22a44d5f23ab4d34d0ef18bbc",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:7:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Plus tard, je lis un journal près de l'entrée.",
      "sha256": "f813445b6c9b83bb42a6b7895423e2e56d0fac62eb97846596a0ee672bba70a2",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Son père va payer les billets pour le musée.",
      "sha256": "5acbfcbac358cd0d83e67aaa63c7503f789c091b58c6b05b745424cc7b9a8d05",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:10:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Un guide en gilet nous montre la girafe.",
      "sha256": "8afff6d655b16720643f22f2b5150c67ac1fc711aca8d63b00d1b823859da502",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:9:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
